+# Security model
+
+KnotRoute v3 uses self-authenticating identities, hop-encrypted circuits and an additional end-to-end rendezvous stream layer.
+
+<Callout type="warning">Do not market v3 as Tor-equivalent anonymity. Traffic correlation, Sybil resistance, guard selection and global-adversary analysis require dedicated research and external review.</Callout>
